  choices = $EXPL$["To obtain copies of the predecessor auditor''s engagement workpapers","To determine the predecessor auditor''s fee structure and billing rates","To request the predecessor recommend Hargrove to the audit client","To assess management integrity when deciding whether to accept engagement"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under AU-C 210.10, the primary purpose of communicating with the predecessor auditor is to evaluate whether to accept the engagement. The successor should inquire about management integrity, disagreements, reasons for the change, and any fraud or illegal acts, with client permission required.
